      "sha": "cc6764aecd70b3c1f08ee940ba3352484dd29dd9",
      "message": "feat: extend unnecessary_host_function_call to all host object types\n\nThe lint matched only soroban_sdk::ledger::Ledger, so every other metered\nhost accessor reachable from Env was invisible to it even though the lint\nname and its documentation promise host function calls in general.\n\nHost types are now listed once in a SOROBAN_HOST_TYPES table covering\nLedger, Crypto (including CryptoHazmat, Bls12_381, Bn254), Prng, Events\nand Deployer, plus an Env-method list for current_contract_address. The\nstorage paths get the same treatment so the def_path comparison chains no\nlonger grow by hand.\n\nTo keep the wider scope from producing false positives, a call is only\nreported when nothing it reads changes between iterations: locals bound\ninside the loop and locals the loop mutates both disqualify it, and an\ninconclusive mutation analysis leaves the call unreported.",
      "isVerified": false,
      "authoredAt": "2026-07-25T11:16:02Z"
    }
  ],
